<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44154" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκαιρ-έω</span></b>  (late, acc. to <i><span class="en">
			Phryn.
			103
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>have opportunity,
				leisure</i> or <i>time</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.342.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				20.9.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				16.12
			</span></i>, etc.: c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲ φαγεῖν ηὐκαίρουν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
					6.31
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.223d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Am.</u>
				33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ διαβῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PEleph.</u>
					29.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς
			τι</span>, <i>devote one's leisure</i> to a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. τοῖς ἀθανάτοις ἑαυτοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chio
					<u>Ep.</u>
					16.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. εἰς οὐδὲν ἕτερον
			ἢ</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				17.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>enjoy good times, prosper</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.60.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς βίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					32.5.12
				</span></i>
			: in this sense also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐκαιρέομαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Posidon.
				59
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be timely</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.64
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
			</span></i>(?) <i><span class="en">
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				215ii2
			</span></i>.</div>
